--- task
id: t22
dataset: section8
kind: correlated subquery per group

--- intent
For each person, list the titles and years of their three most recent documents.

--- edition3
query latest_per_author() {
  match {
    $p: Person
    from { match { $p authored $d } return { $d } order { $d.year desc } limit 3 }
  }
  return { $p.name, $d.title, $d.year }
}
